# UI (shadcn + legacy)

## Reference repo (required)

- Canonical UI: **https://github.com/anbui1510/an_ui** (fork of shadcn-ui/ui, style `base-nova`).
- Before designing/changing dialogs, buttons, forms: open matching examples under `an_ui/apps/v4/examples/base/` (clone to `/tmp/an_ui` if needed).
- Add missing primitives: `npx shadcn@latest add <name>` → `src/components/ui/*`.
- Docs: `docs/DESIGN-UI.md`.

## Prefer shadcn for new / account / dialogs

- Import from `@/components/ui/*` (`Button`, `Dialog`, `AlertDialog`, `Input`, `Label`, …).
- Theme tokens: `src/styles/shadcn.css` (default shadcn light/dark). Toggle dark via `html.dark` (see `applyThemeClass` in `App.jsx`).
- Map legacy buttons: `action-btn primary` → `<Button>` with brand emerald CTA when confirming/saving; outline/secondary for secondary; `danger` → `variant="destructive"`.
- Confirm popups: `ConfirmDialog` → AlertDialog pattern from an_ui (Media + Footer).

## Keep legacy for schedule chrome

- Do **not** refactor `MonthSheet`, `SheetToolbar`, week Handsontable chrome to shadcn unless the user asks.
- Those areas use `src/index.css` (`.tb-btn`, `.action-btn`, sheet tokens).

## Forbidden

- New UI kits (MUI, Ant, Chakra, etc.).
- Inventing a new color/font system; do not replace Be Vietnam Pro globally.
- Random marketing gradients / “AI landing page” layouts for in-app screens.

## Adding components

```bash
npx shadcn@latest add <name>
```
